{"id":"617666","name":"全麦开花馒头","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/617666/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"全麦馒头","amount":"几个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5g"}],"sub":[{"name":"开水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"馒头煮化。","img":"images/617666/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"凉至温热，放酵母拌匀。","img":"images/617666/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放面粉。","img":"images/617666/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"images/617666/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放温暖发酵。","img":"images/617666/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"发好的年揉光排气，分成小剂子。","img":"images/617666/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉光。","img":"images/617666/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"如图切开。","img":"images/617666/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"整理一下。","img":"images/617666/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"一共16个剂子，做了8个开花馒头，做了8个普通馒头，放一边二次醒发。","img":"images/617666/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"二次发好的馒头。","img":"images/617666/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"电饼铛物色，放馒头烙一下，切口那边朝下。","img":"images/617666/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"烙金黄即可。","img":"images/617666/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"入蒸锅。。","img":"images/617666/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"定时25分钟。","img":"images/617666/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"这个蒸锅锅盖是平顶的，其实不太适合蒸馒头包子，水滴滴下来落在面食上，影响颜值。","img":"images/617666/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/617666/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}